WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:00.990
Hello!

00:00:01.221 --> 00:00:04.190
A customer comes once, and never comes back.

00:00:04.443 --> 00:00:06.030
Every salon knows that feeling.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.230
A stamp card is the simplest way to keep customers:

00:00:09.261 --> 00:00:11.550
collect enough stamps, and get a reward.

00:00:11.796 --> 00:00:17.070
With VaraaAi, you can create a stamp card with a QR code in just thirty seconds.

00:00:17.259 --> 00:00:19.593
It's free, there are no paper cards to print,

00:00:19.543 --> 00:00:22.030
and your customers don't need to install an app.

00:00:22.541 --> 00:00:28.351
Open varaaai.com, scroll to the bottom of the page, and tap Free loyalty cards.

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:29.871
There are two ways to start.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:30.670
One:

00:00:30.732 --> 00:00:32.676
tap Try it now, no email needed,

00:00:32.626 --> 00:00:35.871
to go straight to your card studio with a sample card.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:36.751
Two:

00:00:37.019 --> 00:00:40.911
enter your Salon name and Your email, and tap Create free cards.

00:00:41.097 --> 00:00:42.191
There's no password to set.

00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:46.123
In your card studio, the first thing to do is set up the card.

00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:51.403
Under Your stamp card, choose the Stamps for a reward, for example ten stamps.

00:00:51.673 --> 00:00:55.643
Then write the Reward, for example fifteen percent off your next visit.

00:00:55.745 --> 00:00:56.603
Tap Save.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:00.203
This applies to every card, including the ones already given.

00:01:00.796 --> 00:01:01.486
Step two:

00:01:01.597 --> 00:01:02.846
give a customer a card.

00:01:03.137 --> 00:01:08.073
Under Give a customer a card, enter the Customer's name and Customer's email,

00:01:08.023 --> 00:01:09.406
then tap Create card.

00:01:09.753 --> 00:01:13.966
The customer gets their VIP card with a QR code by email straight away.

00:01:14.235 --> 00:01:15.006
No email?

00:01:15.172 --> 00:01:16.526
You can still create the card:

00:01:16.715 --> 00:01:19.486
the customer just takes a photo of the QR code on screen.

00:01:20.157 --> 00:01:21.010
Step three:

00:01:21.235 --> 00:01:23.890
each time the customer visits, you add a stamp.

00:01:24.302 --> 00:01:27.226
Under Scan a card at a visit, open your phone's camera,

00:01:27.176 --> 00:01:29.890
and point it at the QR code on the customer's card.

00:01:30.169 --> 00:01:32.050
Or type the card code into the box.

00:01:32.243 --> 00:01:35.330
The card opens, and you tap Add 1 stamp.

00:01:35.663 --> 00:01:37.057
If the customer has an email,

00:01:37.007 --> 00:01:39.650
they're told automatically that they've got a new stamp.

00:01:40.247 --> 00:01:43.119
When the customer reaches the last stamp, the star,

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:45.664
they've earned the reward shown on their card.

00:01:46.081 --> 00:01:49.424
When they use it, you redeem it, and the card starts a new round.

00:01:49.851 --> 00:01:55.504
Under Customers, you can see all your cards, and search by name, email or card code.

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.064
You can even add a stamp straight from the list.

00:01:58.578 --> 00:01:59.580
One important note.

00:01:59.735 --> 00:02:03.020
If you started with Try it now, your salon isn't saved yet.

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:05.543
Enter your email and tap Save my salon,

00:02:05.493 --> 00:02:10.060
so you don't lose your customers' cards if you change phones or clear your browser.

00:02:10.409 --> 00:02:10.940
And that's it:

00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:12.780
your salon has its own stamp card.

00:02:13.129 --> 00:02:15.168
After this, watch the Referrals lesson,

00:02:15.118 --> 00:02:17.820
to see how your regulars can bring in new customers.

00:02:18.093 --> 00:02:19.500
Now take the quiz below.
